('TXT_KEY_SOL_DIPLO_FIRST_GREETING_1','I''ve considered several ways this meeting might unfold. Let''s see which one you choose.'),
('TXT_KEY_SOL_DIPLO_GREETING_NEUTRAL_HELLO_1','Speak. I''m listening.'),
('TXT_KEY_SOL_DIPLO_GREETING_POLITE_HELLO_1','Good. We have time to think this through properly.'),
('TXT_KEY_SOL_DIPLO_GREETING_HOSTILE_HELLO_1','I''ve examined your behavior carefully. The pattern is not encouraging.'),
('TXT_KEY_SOL_DIPLO_DECLAREWAR_1','I have considered the alternatives. This remains the correct conclusion.'),
('TXT_KEY_SOL_DIPLO_ATTACKED_1','So you''ve chosen the impatient solution. Very well.'),
('TXT_KEY_SOL_DIPLO_DEFEATED_1','Then my reasoning was incomplete. Make better use of what remains.'),
('TXT_KEY_SOL_DIPLO_GREETING_AT_WAR_HOSTILE_1','You mistook patience for inactivity.'),
('TXT_KEY_SOL_DIPLO_STRATEGIC_TRADE_1','I''ve examined the exchange. These terms should benefit us both.'),
('TXT_KEY_SOL_DIPLO_TRADE_ACCEPT_ACCEPTABLE_1','Agreed. The reasoning is sound.'),
('TXT_KEY_SOL_DIPLO_TRADE_REJECT_UNACCEPTABLE_1','No. The value does not justify the exchange.'),
('TXT_KEY_SOL_DIPLO_WORK_WITH_US_1','Continued cooperation appears advantageous. I suggest we formalize it.'),
('TXT_KEY_SOL_DIPLO_WORK_WITH_US_YES_1','Sensible.'),
('TXT_KEY_SOL_DIPLO_WORK_WITH_US_NO_1','Then I will revise my assumptions.'),
('TXT_KEY_SOL_DIPLO_DENOUNCE_1','I have considered your actions long enough. Others should be aware of the conclusion.'),
('TXT_KEY_SOL_DIPLO_RESPONSE_TO_BEING_DENOUNCED_1','Noted. I''ll account for the change.'),
('TXT_KEY_SOL_DIPLO_AGGRESSIVE_MILITARY_WARNING_1','Your deployment is difficult to interpret as accidental. Explain it.'),
('TXT_KEY_SOL_DIPLO_PEACE_OFFER_1','Continued conflict no longer produces a rational return.'),
('TXT_KEY_SOL_DIPLO_PEACE_MADE_BY_HUMAN_GRACIOUS_1','Agreed. There are better uses for our time.'),
('TXT_KEY_SOL_DELIBERATION','Deep Deliberation'),
('TXT_KEY_SOL_DELIBERATION_HELP','Normally produced Buildings and World/National Wonders qualify after four uninterrupted production turns. Science equals floor(actual game-speed Production requirement times 12%), +2 percentage points per additional turn, capped at 24%, minimum 1 Science. Switching to any different order resets the counter, including returning during the same turn. Purchases, free grants, captures, Units, Projects, Processes and nonpositive-cost Buildings do not qualify.'),
('TXT_KEY_SOL_INSIGHT','Insight'),
('TXT_KEY_SOL_INSIGHT_HELP','Every Production-built World or National Wonder grants its city 1 Insight, up to 5, even before four construction turns. Each Insight adds +2% Science and +2% civilian Great Person generation. Capture permanently removes all Insight; recapture does not restore it. Reasoning Institutes add +1 Science per 2 Insight and +10% Great Person generation.'),
('TXT_KEY_SOL_TRAIT','Deep Deliberation'),
('TXT_KEY_SOL_TRAIT_HELP','Completing a Building or Wonder after at least 4 turns of uninterrupted construction generates Science equal to 12% of its Production Cost, increasing by 2% per additional construction turn, up to 24%. Production-built World and National Wonders also grant that city 1 Insight, up to 5. Each Insight provides +2% Science and +2% civilian Great Person generation. Insight is lost on capture.'),
('TXT_KEY_SOL_DUMMY','Solar development'),
('TXT_KEY_SOL_NOTICE_TITLE','Deep Deliberation'),
('TXT_KEY_SOL_NOTICE_SCIENCE','{1_City} completed {2_Building} after {3_Turns} turns of uninterrupted construction and generated {4_Science} [ICON_RESEARCH] Science.'),
('TXT_KEY_SOL_NOTICE_INSIGHT','{1_City} gained Insight ({2_Count}/5).'),
('TXT_KEY_SOL_NOTICE_MAX_INSIGHT','{1_City} has reached maximum Insight (5/5).'),
